# Production regression adapter proposal

This separate adapter preserves the frozen collector stage unchanged (freeze SHA25659629ecca2019b50da247e4226498d583a65d503ae47350a47b0fe7499c88765). `adaptation.json` records every mapping. Proposed production paths are `scripts/verify-sketch-geometry.mjs`, `scripts/sketch-collector-process.mjs`, `tests/sketch-collector.test.mjs` and `tests/fixtures/sketch-collector/{runner,descendant}.mjs` within the Studio product. Collector, helper and both fixtures are exact frozen copies; only test imports, private scratch location, observation sink/cleanup and the small stdout count marker were adapted. All17 test assertions are unchanged.

Normal tests create synthetic files only in a private `rea-sketch-collector-*` directory under `os.tmpdir()`, write observations there and remove their owned directory afterward. A focused recorder may provide a separately owned direct `os.tmpdir()/rea-sketch-collector-*` directory for retained detailed observations. The test validates that scope and never writes generated files in production tests, app results or source directories. Its child fixture paths are explicit production test fixtures; its helper import is the production scripts path. The stage validation executes these same relative paths within the adapter's isolated product-shaped tree. This is preparation for production installation, not evidence of an installed production run.

The synthetic suite does not invoke original Excalidraw helpers or repeat the28 geometry tests. The unchanged historical cf044 collector and728f geometry receipt remain pinned in the prior frozen stage. Child deadlines/log caps do not extend to bootstrap-fetch or fingerprint I/O and do not establish race-free Windows descendant isolation. Root reviews/installs proposed files before any fresh production claim.

Run `node work/sketch-collector-production-adapter/verify-adapter.mjs`. It preserves bounded raw output and detailed synthetic observations in a new ignored `.local/run-*` folder belonging only to this adapter, with exact before/after candidate/stage/explicit production identities. Temporary diagnostic files are created in owned OS temp and safely removed after collection. No production/results mutation occurs.
